# A* Pathfinder

> An interactive grid-based pathfinding visualiser built with openFrameworks

![example1](images/example1)
---

## Features

- 🗺️ **Visual grid** — resizable from 8×8 to 64×64 via a live slider
- 🧱 **Wall painting** — click and drag to place obstacles
- ⚡ **A\* with diagonals** — Euclidean heuristic, straight and diagonal movement
- 🎮 **Live GUI controls** — OpenFrameworks oxGui

---

## Controls

| Key + action | What it does |
|---|---|
| `s` + click | Set the start cell |
| `t` + click | Set the target cell |
| `w` + drag | Paint wall cells |
| `a` | Run A\* and display the path |
| `r` | Reset the grid |

---

## How to build

1. Clone or download this repo into your `openFrameworks/apps/myApps/` folder
2. Open the `.sln` file in Visual Studio
3. Switch the build config to **Release / x64**
4. Hit `Ctrl + Shift + B` — the binary will appear in `bin/`

